From 75612c79654890207fbf5045bdcf37b7f991cc02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:49:06 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] configs: gtactive3wifi: Keep EFI variables readable at
 runtime

EFI_RT_VOLATILE_STORE: with variables in a file on the ESP, Linux can
otherwise not read any of them after ExitBootServices, so efivarfs stays
empty and systemd-gpt-auto in the initrd does not find systemd-boot's
LoaderDevicePartUUID.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/gtactive3wifi_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/gtactive3wifi_defconfig b/configs/gtactive3wifi_defconfig
index c5371960..6e0a1deb 100644
--- a/configs/gtactive3wifi_defconfig
+++ b/configs/gtactive3wifi_defconfig
@@ -99,3 +99,4 @@ CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH=y
 CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH_BLOCK=y
 CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH_BLOCK_INTERFACE_NAME="scsi"
 CONFIG_FASTBOOT_FLASH_BLOCK_DEVICE_ID=0
+CONFIG_EFI_RT_VOLATILE_STORE=y
-- 
2.56.0

